From 5e3b90c80c80b53335f3466bdd08faa7aefc48e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ILFforever <hammymukura@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:41:52 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] X-H2 5.33 on the X-H2 board: boots to REC

Ports the X-H2 5.33 firmware onto the shared X-H2 board the same way. Its
first start needs one more MENU (the auto power off temperature screen).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
