+
+# GPIO pad model of a start that runs the stock setup: the setup programs each port's +4 word
+# (output enables) and +8 word, which the default "legacy" model misreads. "data-latch" (+4 output
+# enable, +0 output data) is the X-T5, X100VI and X-H2S model. Set for ROM and SD card starts only.
+[[window_options]]
